        registering: 1 key,  0 hash, 0 peer,  public_key=null
        committing:  2 key,  1 hash, 0 peer,  public_key=null
        sharing:     2 key,  2 hash, 1 peer,  public_key=null
        done:        2 key,  2 hash, 2 peer,  public_key 为两 key 顺序
